title: Workers’ Rights
subtitle: Labour: working time, collective agreements, derogations.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_labor_rights.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'labor_rights') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.labor_rights (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.1). Opening and closing the card are free; a
// confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser who opened the card. Z — 0.94 (decisions of
// 24 X 2026): every option has a gain and a cost; the collective agreement takes the branch where our union is strongest.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'labor_rights');
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_labor_rights');
!}

= Workers’ rights

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

Labour enforces the statutory working time and the conditions in the plants. Every gain of the workers strengthens the pressure of business on the cabinet, which now stands at [+ pl_gc_business +] of 100.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

[+ pl_gc_plants +]

- @inspection
- @collective
- @derogation
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@inspection
title: Introduce a labour inspection
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month and needs a law in the Sejm. The workers are less discontented (−3), but business presses harder on the cabinet (+4).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'labor_rights', 'inspection').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_labor_rights_inspection_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'labor_rights', 'inspection');
!}
go-to: result

@collective
title: Bring about a collective agreement
subtitle: No cost to the budget; the agreement covers the branch where our union is strongest (now: [+ pl_gc_collective_branch +]). Wages rise for two months, most in industry (+1.2 percentage points), but business presses harder (+3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'labor_rights', 'collective').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_labor_rights_collective_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'labor_rights', 'collective');
!}
go-to: result

@derogation
title: Agree to derogations from the eight-hour day
subtitle: No cost to the budget, for half a year in a plant threatened with closure. Business presses less (−4), but the workers of the plant are more discontented (+3) and the Left of PPS protests (+3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'labor_rights', 'derogation').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_labor_rights_derogation_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'labor_rights', 'derogation');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Workers’ rights

